[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Configuration:

1. Copy %%ETCDIR%%/config.yaml.sample to %%ETCDIR%%/config.yaml and
   enter immich_url and immich_api_key.

2. To keep the key and the kiosk password out of that file, name
   KIOSK_IMMICH_API_KEY_FILE and KIOSK_PASSWORD_FILE in
   immich_kiosk_env instead.

3. sysrc immich_kiosk_enable=YES && service immich_kiosk start

Upstream listens on port 3000, which www/immich-public-proxy already
uses; this port starts on 3001 instead, set with immich_kiosk_port.
It answers on every address and has no authentication unless a password
is set, so keep it off untrusted networks.
EOM
}
]
